ceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/12/global-financial-watchdog-calls-for-cross-border-information-sharing-planning-for-stablecoin-crisis","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T11:02:38.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"jt1qb1tk2tb06b92xoj2bqhro"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美联储哈玛克称应更快、更频繁小幅调整利率以遏制通胀","summary":"克利夫兰联储主席哈玛克表示，关税和AI基础设施投资正推高成本，美联储应维持限制性货币政策，并在必要时更快、更频繁地小幅调整利率。她未明确支持10月加息，强调解释政策反应机制不等于承诺未来利率路径，后续决策仍取决于通胀及其他经济数据。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783474","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T20:33:14.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"vl4xlzzox1fo4w1e0kpyep227"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"英国冻结涉 Prince Group 财务主管的1200万美元伦敦顶层公寓","summary":"英国冻结了与 Prince Group 财务主管 Thet Li（Li Tian）有关、价值900万英镑（1200万美元）的伦敦顶层公寓，并于10月12日冻结一处约1.7亿元人民币（约2400万美元）的伦敦豪宅及奢侈手表。美国司法部还寻求没收据称与该集团活动有关的约127,271枚 Bitcoin，价值约150亿美元；香港此前也冻结了与 Chen Zhi 和 Li 有关的约89亿港元资产。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/uk-freezes-prince-group-finance-chief-penthouse/","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T10:17:53.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"kp4idxt35k2rn1nwlhk6e0mx1"}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null