:"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"JPMorgan与Goldman Sachs限制对Volta AI 50亿美元贷款出售的风险敞口","summary":"JPMorgan Chase与Goldman Sachs在为AI初创公司Volta Infrastructure Holdings Ltd.出售50亿美元贷款时采取罕见措施，限制自身风险敞口。投资者正要求AI热潮相关高风险债务提供更高收益率。","sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-12/jpmorgan-goldman-curb-exposure-on-5-billion-volta-ai-loan-sale","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T18:30:06.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"e7xh43jmf2go8zv0cd164bg5l"}]},{"label":"观点与教程","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"沙特称胡塞武装持续发动无人机和导弹袭击","summary":"沙特表示，伊朗支持的胡塞武装仍在持续对该国发动无人机和导弹袭击，利雅得机场运营暂停时间也被延长。周六袭击造成12人死亡、300多人受伤，周日另一轮袭击造成1人死亡、近12人受伤；澳大利亚、新西兰等多国已发布前往沙特的旅行警告。特朗普称美国“可能”加入沙特对胡塞武装的报复，伊朗则表示愿推动沙特与也门展开对话，并仍在评估美国关于重开霍尔木兹海峡的回应。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/12/us-iran-war-trump-hormuz-saudi.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T10:48:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"hn1kqpeivcycn1a63nu1yw0uc"}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"SWI Group融资$894 million，将前FTX比特币矿企转向AI","summary":"SWI Group从机构投资者处融资800 million euros（$894 million），公司估值达到6.1 billion euros，并计划扩大欧洲和美国的AI及数据中心项目。SWI将其控制的前FTX-backed比特币矿企Genesis Digital Assets更名为SWI Digital，拟把美国和瑞典设施用于AI workloads，同时出售其在哈萨克斯坦的场地。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/12/swi-raises-usd894-million-to-repurpose-former-ftx-bitcoin-miner-genesis-digital-to-ai","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T10:27:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"SWI Group以$500 million收购GDA约77%经济权益，将比特币挖矿基础设施转向AI","summary":null,"sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/ftx-bitcoin-mining-infrastructure-ai-swi/","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T05:38:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"l2xrt23jk11ezceuj3t72x9ja"}],"citationId":"rwwg4zjaxl4rw33kks4nxga08"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"沙特拟将输油管道能力扩至每日1000万桶","summary":"沙特能源大臣表示，沙特计划在两到三年内将通往波斯湾以外目的地的输油管道能力提升至每日1000万桶，并升级东西输油管道泵站。天然气管道改造后最快七至八周投入使用，初期日输油能力约120万桶，理论上可提升至每日300万桶，但计划输油至明年5月后恢复天然气输送。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783450","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T11:34:03.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"d5zyawpmu40qfi9y3s7n5t1r9"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"伊朗打击“违规”船只升级，多艘空载超级油轮避开波斯湾","summary":"伊朗持续打击其认定的“违规”船只，至少10艘VLCC及数艘苏伊士型油轮在驶向阿联酋富查伊拉港途中停航或掉头。空载油轮撤离可能拖慢依赖海上接驳的海湾原油运输，船东还需重新评估航线、船舶识别系统、保险与延误成本。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783471","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T20:00:10.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"jk3rf8qj7a41twqvxzsdtwb5c"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"哈萨克斯坦央行拟将黄金储备占比降至75%左右并增配美元资产","summary":"哈萨克斯坦央行计划在年底前将黄金占外汇储备的比重下调约3个百分点至75%左右，转而配置更多美元资产，减持将通过期权和实物黄金两种方式进行，各占一半。美国10年期国债收益率上周升至24年来高位，提高了美元资产的利息回报；尽管土耳其和俄罗斯已减持黄金，波兰、中国和乌兹别克斯坦今年仍在增持，全球央行整体保持净买入。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783465","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T15:36:43.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"witsqs2tcl44lhmtf0tf6bnl2"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"全球智能手机市场2026年第三季度出货量暴跌20%","summary":"Counterpoint Research初步数据显示，2026年第三季度全球智能手机出货量同比下降20%，创2012年以来同期最低水平。三星和苹果市场份额升至23%和22%，小米出货量下降逾30%至10%份额，OPPO和vivo份额降至9%和8%。存储芯片供应紧张与AI基础设施建设推高元件成本，厂商普遍上调售价、削减低端产品出货并转向高端市场。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783481","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T23:05:52.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"c4dexnwbwgntrxp9cbalpjfjh"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"LVMH第三季度时装与皮具销售下滑，奢侈品行业复苏预期受挫","summary":"LVMH第三季度有机销售同比增长1%至€18.5 billion（$20.7 billion），低于分析师预期的1.3%；时装与皮具部门有机销售下降5%，降幅高于预期的1.8%。受中国需求疲弱影响，亚洲销售下降5%，美国销售增长5%；业绩更新发布后，LVMH在美股价下跌近3%。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/12/lvmh-fashion-and-leather-sales-slide-in-q3-dashing-sector-hopes.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T16:42:05.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"d1o71lhbz3hopis9jwc4srfew"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"慢雾余弦称 Ledger Flex 也涉及 CryptoBilis 经销商事件","summary":"慢雾创始人余弦称，其团队跟进的强关联案例中有一例涉及 Ledger Flex 设备。此前已知受影响设备为 Ledger Nano X，Ledger 表示所有已确认案例均涉及通过东南亚经销商 CryptoBilis 售出的设备；余弦称 Ledger 主流系列设备可能都在该经销商处被动了手脚。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a12d61-bac8-71f6-8d58-323c606ac362","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T23:51:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":5,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Ledger调查东南亚经销商涉硬件植入与资金损失事件","summary":null,"sourceName":"Bitcoin Magazine","sourceUrl":"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/ledger-investigates-fund-losses","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T17:19:33.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"g8hzt0d7803e98rs5xtjcnupk"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"zhtuzzcc87o104071m3ivpmdi","title":"Ledger 确认受影响硬件钱包存在隐藏植入物，疑似加密货币盗窃调查扩大","summary":null,"sourceName":"CryptoSlate","sourceUrl":"https://cryptoslate.com/ledger-confirms-hidden-implant-in-crypto-wallet-as-93-million-theft-investigation-widens/","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T06:00:34.000Z","firstParty":fals